{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude96 <strong>BATTLE KITTENS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Kittens</strong> is a turn-based strategy game simulating an all-out war between feline soldiers.<br>Fight in <strong>team modes</strong> or <strong>free-for-all battles</strong> and claw your way to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>experience points</strong>, unlock <strong>new weapons</strong>, and master every tool of cat destruction.<br>There\u2019s no Campaign or Story mode \u2014 this is pure <strong>PVP warfare</strong>, cat versus cat.<br>Only the clever and the clawed will survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your arsenal includes <strong>rifles, grenades, rocket launchers</strong>, and even <strong>airship strikes</strong>.<br>Each weapon has its own unique mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rifles</strong> use an aiming system with a bit of natural shake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grenades</strong> and <strong>rocket launchers</strong> have a <strong>power bar</strong> to control range and adjustable firing angle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some grenades and rockets can <strong>detonate early</strong> if you press the fire button again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>airship attack</strong> uses a <strong>map targeting system</strong> \u2014 aim your cursor to select position and rotation, then rain chaos from above.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some weapons have limited uses per match, others don\u2019t.<br>Each behaves differently \u2014 you\u2019ll learn their quirks as you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc31 <strong>THE KITTENS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Team (4 vs 4)</strong> or <strong>Brawl</strong> modes, up to <strong>8 players</strong> battle it out.<br>Each player controls one <strong>Cat Soldier</strong>, who can move and attack <strong>only during their turn</strong> \u2014 lasting up to <strong>45 seconds</strong>.<br>In <strong>1 vs 1 Team mode</strong>, two players each command a <strong>squad of four cats</strong> sharing a common weapon inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feline soldiers speak their minds throughout the fight \u2014<br>barking (or rather, meowing) orders at the start of their turn, growling before an attack, or making their last heroic meow when they fall.<br>At the end of every round, a <strong>gritty cat commentator</strong> will give his own take on the chaos.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121420?t=1763551654","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121420/bdce544236a0fc17663747a47899c00c33da0d1d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763551654","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121420/f802e93bb19cf26f8df43e89e539a8d93165fe64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763551654","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121420/f802e93bb19cf26f8df43e89e539a8d93165fe64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763551654","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude96 <strong>BATTLE KITTENS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Kittens</strong> is a turn-based strategy game simulating an all-out war between feline soldiers.<br>Fight in <strong>team modes</strong> or <strong>free-for-all battles</strong> and claw your way to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\